{
  "_comment": "Maps a scene's `icon` key to a file in assets/icons/. Drop your 22-icon Flaticon pack in with these exact folder names and every entry resolves to the real art. Until then the engine generates a Fluent-style stand-in and flags it. `red: true` means the source art contains red and gets recoloured into the scene accent (brand rule: no red anywhere).",

  "icons": {
